# `constitution regen` fails with a precise error when an ADR's category
# isn't in the configured vocabulary (M1 DoD: malformed ADRs fail with
# precise file/field errors; spec §2.5's hard-error stance).

! exec constitution regen
stderr 'field "category": not in the configured category vocabulary \[architecture\] \(got "bogus"\)'
! stdout .
! exists constitution/constitution.md

-- constitution.yml --
schemaVersion: 1
categories:
  - architecture

